  "title": "HC 23 (2024 Regular Session): Constitution; amend to provide that only citizens of the United States are allowed the opportunity to vote.",
  "urls": [
    "https://billstatus.ls.state.ms.us/2024/pdf/history/HC/HC0023.xml",
    "https://billstatus.ls.state.ms.us/documents/2024/pdf/HC/HC0023PS.pdf",
